X-WR-CALNAME:ZoKB / NIS2 deadlines (CZ)
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:zokb-effective-20251101@0-click.com
DTSTAMP:20260607T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251102
SUMMARY:ZoKB (zákon č. 264/2025 Sb.) takes effect
DESCRIPTION:The new Czech Cybersecurity Act (NIS2 transposition) is effective from this date. If you may be in scope, run the self-identification calculator on the NÚKIB portal. Reference only — not legal advice. https://portal.nukib.gov.cz
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:zokb-register-20251231@0-click.com
DTSTAMP:20260607T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260101
SUMMARY:Deadline: report regulated service to NÚKIB (within 60 days of effect)
DESCRIPTION:If regulated, you must report provision of a regulated service via the NÚKIB portal within 60 days of the Act taking effect (counted from 1 Nov 2025). Verify the exact date for your case. https://portal.nukib.gov.cz
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:ZoKB: NÚKIB registration deadline approaching
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
